/E (The ClimateScope project successfully demonstrates the application of data-driven analytics and interactive visualization techniques to analyze and interpret large-scale climate data. By integrating historical and near real-time weather datasets, the system provides meaningful insights into key climatic parameters such as temperature, humidity, precipitation, wind speed, air quality, and extreme weather events across multiple regions.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
313 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Through systematic data preprocessing, exploratory analysis, and advanced visualization development, the project delivers an intuitive and scalable web-based dashboard that enables effective exploration of climate patterns, regional variability, and anomalies. The inclusion of an Infrastructure Risk Management module further enhances the practical relevance of the application by translating climate indicators into actionable risk metrics for resilience planning.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
